{"schema":3,"source_digest":"cc48f81d6f9dd145fd70f6d066e7c6f38039f5bfada938a1f077dd79e09a965c","dependencies":[],"processor_digest":"05407ea0b9fb79a4fb824e492c01e0ff56cb871c7ff102d6a368e95af20aa6f4","result":{"html":"<html><head></head><body><h1 id=\"nixos\">NixOS</h1>\n<p><code>sessiond</code> is not officially supported on NixOS and requires additional manual\nconfiguration. NixOS is deeply integrated with <code>logind</code>, which <code>sessiond</code>\nreplaces, so some system components may continue to depend on <code>logind</code> and need\nseparate adjustment.</p>\n<h2 id=\"install-the-module\">Install the module</h2>\n<p>Choose your prefered way of pinning the source.</p>\n<h3 id=\"flakes\">Flakes</h3>\n<p>Add the input to your flake and import its module in your NixOS configuration:</p>\n<html><head></head><body><pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-nix\"><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">inputs</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">sessiond</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">url</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">\"</span><span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">git+https://tangled.org/r0chd.pl/sessiond</span><span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">\"</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(97,175,239);\">outputs</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">self</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">,</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">nixpkgs</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">,</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">sessiond</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">,</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">...</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">:</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">nixosConfigurations</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">myHost</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">nixpkgs</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">lib</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(97,175,239);\">nixosSystem</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">modules</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">[</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">./configuration.nix</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">sessiond</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">nixosModules</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">default</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">services</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">sessiond</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">enable</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(209,154,102);\">true</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">]</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><br></code></pre></body></html>\n<h3 id=\"npins\">npins</h3>\n<html><head></head><body><pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span style=\"color:rgb(97,175,239);\">npins</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">add</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">git</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">--name</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">sessiond</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">https://tangled.org/r0chd.pl/sessiond</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">--branch</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">master</span><br></code></pre></body></html>\n<html><head></head><body><pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-nix\"><span style=\"color:rgb(198,120,221);\">let</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;sources&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(198,120,221);\">import</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">./npins</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;sessiond&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(198,120,221);\">import</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">sources</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">sessiond</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">outPath</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(198,120,221);\">in</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">imports</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">[</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">sessiond</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">nixosModules</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">default</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">]</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">services</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">sessiond</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">enable</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(209,154,102);\">true</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><br></code></pre></body></html>\n<h2 id=\"using-sessiond-in-place-of-logind\">Using sessiond in place of logind</h2>\n<p>Enabling the module does not disable <code>logind</code>. Running both services causes\nconflicts, each attempts to move the session leader process, such as a greeter,\ninto its own cgroup. Moving the process out of the other service's cgroup\ndisrupts its session tracking. Disable <code>logind</code> when using <code>sessiond</code>.</p>\n<html><head></head><body><pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-nix\"><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">pkgs</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">,</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">...</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">:</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">services</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">logind</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">enable</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(209,154,102);\">false</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><br></code></pre></body></html>\n<p>This keeps <code>systemd</code> as the system service manager but removes ability for <code>systemd</code>\nto manage user services. You also lose ability to view <code>systemd</code> service status without\nroot permissions</p>\n<h2 id=\"pam-integration\">PAM integration</h2>\n<p>The module starts the daemon but does not add the PAM session rule. To register\nconsole logins, configure the <code>login</code> PAM service:</p>\n<html><head></head><body><pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-nix\"><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">config</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">,</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">...</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">:</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">security</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">pam</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">services</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">login</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">rules</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">session</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">sessiond</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">{</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">control</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">\"</span><span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">optional</span><span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">\"</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">modulePath</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">\"</span><span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">${</span><span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">config</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">services</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">sessiond</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">package</span><span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">/lib/security/pam_sessiond.so</span><span style=\"color:rgb(152,195,121);\">\"</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(86,182,194);\">order</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(171,178,191);\">=</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(209,154,102);\">900</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">;</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(132,139,152);\">}</span><br></code></pre></body></html>\n<p>For other login paths, add the rule to the corresponding PAM service as well.\nConfiguring <code>login</code> alone does not configure a display manager or SSH.</p>\n<h2 id=\"known-issues\">Known issues</h2>\n<p>The following problems remain unresolved in this setup.</p>\n<h3 id=\"greetd-greeter\">greetd greeter</h3>\n<p>The greetd greeter fails to start, leaving a black screen. The cause has not\nyet been identified.</p>\n<h3 id=\"switching-configurations\">Switching configurations</h3>\n<p><code>switch-to-configuration</code> does not currently work with this setup for two reasons:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>It uses <code>logind</code> to list active users.</li>\n<li>It relies on per-user systemd service managers to start\n<code>nixos-activation.service</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Both dependencies need to be addressed for configuration switching to work\nwith <code>sessiond</code> in place of <code>logind</code>.</p>\n<p>For now, use <code>nixos-rebuild boot</code> instead of <code>nixos-rebuild switch</code> to build the\nconfiguration and make it the default for the next boot, then reboot to apply\nit. Include your usual flake or configuration arguments:</p>\n<html><head></head><body><pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span style=\"color:rgb(97,175,239);\">sudo</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">nixos-rebuild</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">boot</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">--flake</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">.#myHost</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(97,175,239);\">sudo</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(232,102,113);\">reboot</span><br></code></pre></body></html>\n</body></html>","headers":[{"text":"NixOS","level":1,"id":"nixos"},{"text":"Install the module","level":2,"id":"install-the-module"},{"text":"Flakes","level":3,"id":"flakes"},{"text":"npins","level":3,"id":"npins"},{"text":"Using sessiond in place of logind","level":2,"id":"using-sessiond-in-place-of-logind"},{"text":"PAM integration","level":2,"id":"pam-integration"},{"text":"Known issues","level":2,"id":"known-issues"},{"text":"greetd greeter","level":3,"id":"greetd-greeter"},{"text":"Switching configurations","level":3,"id":"switching-configurations"}],"title":"NixOS","included_files":[]},"frontmatter":null}